The Nim files that start with a `port-of` or `port-part-of` line are
translations of the TypeScript file they name, taken from Pele 1.13.0 (commit
3a2f075ee0c3d914f0fad3545fc0f193693975ac), and have been changed by being
rewritten in another language. Tests and test data replayed from the Pele
repository (including the Mermaid specs and grammars Pele ported, MIT,
Copyright (c) 2014 - 2022 Knut Sveidqvist) come from
the same version.

src/nimaki/fdlibm.nim and the C build's hypot in src/nimaki/jsmath.nim are
translations of functions of V8 (https://v8.dev): src/base/ieee754.cc and
src/builtins/math.tq of V8 12.4. The first is adapted from fdlibm:

